  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S Vantage Biotech Pvt. Ltd vs Drugs Licensing Cum Controlling ... on 25 June, 2024 In The High Court Of Uttarakhand At Nainital Hon'Ble The Chief Justice Ms. Ritu Bahri And Hon'Ble Sri Justice Rakesh Thapliyal 25th June, 2024 Special Appeal No.164 Of 2024 M/s Vantage Biotech Pvt. Ltd. .......Appellant Versus Drugs Licensing cum Controlling Authority and another ...Respondents",
    "facts": "This fee for extended period was deposited on 02.05.2024. 3. In the impugned order dated 13th May, 2024, Annexure No.5 of the writ petition, it is stated that since the application or the deposit of fees in the prescribed online portal of the Food and Drug Administration Department has not been made within a period prescribed.",
    "arguments": "(per Ms. Ritu Bahri, C.J.) Learned counsel for the appellant has referred to the E-challans, which is at page 46, 47, 48 and 49 of the writ petition, whereby the appellant has deposited the fee for renewal of the drug licence, which was expired in the month of December, 2023."
  },
